* ''The leaps run in flowstate'' (operator, 2026-11-11: //"Enact all in flowstate"//). The house walks the leaps of #/the-leaps one after another, each under the gate the operator reconfirmed the same day: one shared implementation in the isomorphic package, substrate bindings alone forking behind capability-named ports, parity cured before a leap lands and never filed, a cross-host test per leap, and a replay landing nothing new (#/rulings, 2026-11-09, parity across vessel types).

